            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EJoin us to learn about the significant improvements and new features of Umbraco 17, the new Long-Term Support release of the CMS now on .NET 10.\n\nWe discuss new consistent date handling, user interface enhancements, the introduction of load balancing for the Backoffice and upgrade considerations from previous versions including Models Builder changes.\nBuilt on .NET 10 (ASP.NET Core 10), Umbraco 17 offers enhanced performance, scalability, and flexibility to meet your project\u0026#39;s unique needs - whether you\u0026#39;re developing a simple site or a large-scale content platform.\n\n\u0026#128240;  Dive into the Umbraco 17 release blog post: https://umbraco.com/blog/umbraco-17-lts-release/\n\u0026#128214;  Visit our Umbraco 17 product page: https://umbraco.com/products/umbraco-cms/umbraco-17/\n\u0026#128279; Ready to learn more? Explore Umbraco 17 documentation: https://docs.umbraco.com/umbraco-cms \n\n\u0026#128209; Specific documentation links:\n- Version-specific upgrade instructions (including system Date/Time migrations \u0026amp; Models Builder changes): https://docs.umbraco.com/umbraco-cms/fundamentals/setup/upgrading/version-specific\n\n- Umbraco Cloud upgrade instructions: https://docs.umbraco.com/umbraco-cloud/optimize-and-maintain-your-site/manage-product-upgrades/product-upgrades/major-upgrades\n\n- Load balancing the Backoffice: https://docs.umbraco.com/umbraco-cms/17.latest/fundamentals/setup/server-setup/load-balancing/load-balancing-backoffice\n\n00:00 Introduction\n01:36 Umbraco/.NET Release Schedule\n02:20 Highlights tour of Umbraco 14-16\n12:04 Load balancing the Backoffice\n17:15 Consistent handling of dates and new Date/Time property editors\n27:20 UI Improvements including Entity Signs, Entity Action shortcuts, Collection Views, Accessibility improvements\n38:49 Changes in Models Builder\n44:20 Upgrade Considerations\n47:20 What\u0026#39;s Next\n49:35 Credits\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EfC9jWUaIXk\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
